    "annotations": [
      {
        "id": "a001",
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "**Firmware (Position Control Mode).** duty = kp 4096/(2 pi)/(256 885) (goal - q), kp the Position P Gain register (an input: the robot changes it every tick); clamped to the current-limit window (kt w +- R i_limit)/V_bus [BAM] and to +-100 % PWM. The goal arrives t_latency late. q is the joint angle (the encoder).",
        "x": 0,
        "y": -170,
        "w": 950,
        "h": 110,
        "color": "blue"
      },
      {
        "id": "a002",
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "**Motor side, play hinge, horn (microduck_rl backlash models).** H-bridge MTF (duty) -> winding R -> GY kt -> gear (armature, BAM M6 friction, back-EMF speed) -> play hinge (2 deg, armature 0.001 kg m^2, damping 0.01 N m s/rad, MuJoCo's soft limit: library/MjBacklash.jl) -> horn. The encoder q is the joint angle, after the play. The joint carries no armature. The friction reads kt i - tau_f sampled every 5 ms (LoadSample).",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 930,
        "w": 1100,
        "h": 130,
        "color": "blue"
      }
    ]
